 "_note": [
  "One 15-minute bucket of NWS storm-based warnings captured verbatim from the IEM sbw archive",
  "(geojson/sbw.geojson?ts=2021-12-11T03:30:00Z), the night of the Mayfield KY tornado. It holds a",
  "real tornado emergency (phenomena TO, is_emergency true, damagetag CATASTROPHIC), real PDS and",
  "ordinary tornado warnings, and severe thunderstorm warnings. Nothing is edited: this is the",
  "product shape playback replays, including the is_emergency and is_pds flags the live board's CAP",
  "feed spells out in parameters instead. The geometry is in Kentucky, so tests widen CONFIG.gaugeBbox",
  "rather than move the polygons."
 ],
